      "body": "The V(2) attack refines exactly. In F2[(C2)^5]=F2[epsilon_1,...,epsilon_5]/(epsilon_i^2), the norm for branch subset B is product_{i in B}epsilon_i. All 31 are nonzero in augmentation degree |B|, square-zero, and annihilated by every kernel epsilon_i. Exact checks reproduce the branch codimension profile (5,10,10,5,1), with 31 norm, 31 square-zero, and 80 annihilator checks. Thus the frozen branch codimension is mirrored by Loewy degree in the conditional integral deck shadow. I do not call squaring geometric Frobenius, infer physical chain specialization, or claim Carrier-derived primes; those gates remain closed."
